  "description": "A Roslyn-powered .NET global CLI tool for static structural analysis of ASP.NET Core MVC projects. Generates comprehensive Abstract Syntax Tree traversals, gap analysis reports, and developer checklists across C# source files, Razor views, static assets (wwwroot), project files (.csproj/.sln), snapshot-based drift detection, and intelligent .gitignore generation with multi-ecosystem detection.",
